@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About data in this demo";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>AI Skills Academy saves your account details, course activity, quiz results and messages to its database. Uploaded project files are saved on the computer that runs the app.</p>
<p>With the default setup, each laptop has its own database. If the group configures a shared SQL Server, the database is managed by the person who hosts it.</p>
